  abilityId: 860018
  abilityName: Spirit Sunder
  abilityDesc: 22 combo powerful Dark attack on all foes, activates Taunt and greatly
    boosts own Def for 1 turn, hugely boosts Atk, Def, Rec for 3 turns, enormously
    boosts critical hit rate for 3 turns, 50% damage reduction for 2 turns, boosts
    damage reduction when guarding for 3 turns & enormously boosts BB gauge when
    guarding for 3 turns
